389 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 105 0 R
/E (The Department for Promotion of Industry and Internal Trade \(DPIIT\), Government of India, has designated AGRODROID PVT. LTD. as a Startup India-recognised company. To solve issues such as labor scarcity, shrinking profit margins, and poor crop planning, they are creating an autonomous rover robot for cotton producers. Agrodroid accomplished important milestones, competing against more than 1000 businesses in the SmartIDEAthon 2023 semifinals and taking home awards from several pitch competitions. Organizations like Sreenidhi ASCEND, AIC Tech Mahindra, STSP and TIIC at IARE have all provided support for them. The founders, Mahesh Vuppu and Suhas Desai, along with K Jeshwanth Reddy, Naveen Gadala, and Md. Adhnan, are leading the team in their effort to technologically transform cotton cultivation. Additionally, they got cloud credits from AWS and Microsoft Founders' Hub Level 2.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [14]
>>
